        "sentences": [
            [
                "17th July 2019",
                "2019年7月17日"
            ],
            [
                "Today is the third day of our journey.",
                "今天是我们旅程的第三天。"
            ],
            [
                "Yesterday we went on a city tour.",
                "昨天我们进行了城市游览。"
            ],
            [
                "The tour guide was very nice.",
                "导游非常好。"
            ],
            [
                "She took us around the old town and showed us some landmarks, including the city hall, the central station, the harbour, and some beautiful old churches.",
                "她带我们游览了老城区，给我们展示了一些地标，包括市政厅、中央车站、港口以及一些漂亮的古老教堂。"
            ],
            [
                "We came back to the guest-house after dinner.",
                "晚饭后我们回到了宾馆。"
            ],
            [
                "Mum couldn't find her purse in the room.",
                "妈妈在房间里找不到她的钱包了。"
            ],
            [
                "She was very worried because if her ID card and driving licence were stolen, she would get in trouble.",
                "她非常担心，因为如果她的身份证和驾照被偷了，她会有麻烦。"
            ],
            [
                "She called the local restaurant we had been to and luckily, a waiter found it.",
                "她给我们去过的当地餐馆打了电话，幸运的是，一个服务员找到了它。"
            ],
            [
                "She hurried to return to the restaurant and got it back.",
                "她赶紧回到餐馆把它拿了回来。"
            ],
            [
                "Mum said there're always more good than bad in the world.",
                "妈妈说世界上总是好事比坏事多。"
            ],
            [
                "What an experience!",
                "真是一次难忘的经历！"
            ],
            [
                "Today we visited a zoo and an aquarium(水族馆).",
                "今天我们参观了一个动物园和一个水族馆。"
            ],
            [
                "We saw many animals.",
                "我们看到了许多动物。"
            ],
            [
                "My favourite is the elephant and Jenny's favourite is the dolphin.",
                "我最喜欢的是大象，珍妮最喜欢的是海豚。"
            ],
            [
                "Jenny was quite surprised to know dolphins are whales, but I already learned about it in my science class.",
                "珍妮很惊讶地知道海豚是鲸类，但我在科学课上已经学过了。"
            ],
            [
                "We had a good time there and we didn't leave until six.",
                "我们在那里玩得很开心，直到六点才离开。"
            ],
            [
                "Tomorrow we will spend all day driving to a national park.",
                "明天我们将花一整天开车去一个国家公园。"
            ],
            [
                "It's far away from the city but the view of nature is great.",
                "它离城市很远，但自然风光很棒。"
            ],
            [
                "We will go camping at a campsite in the forest.",
                "我们将在森林里的露营地露营。"
            ],
            [
                "Dad told us that we might see wild animals on the motorway!",
                "爸爸告诉我们在高速公路上可能会看到野生动物！"
            ],
            [
                "He also promised that he would tell us stories about the brave explorers who discovered the land.",
                "他还承诺会给我们讲那些发现这片土地的勇敢探险家的故事。"
            ],
            [
                "I hope we can arrive before the sun goes down—I don't want to miss the beautiful sunset!",
                "我希望我们能在太阳下山前到达——我不想错过美丽的日落！"
            ]
        ]
    },
